  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Limiting the negative impacts of oil &amp; gas on nature &amp; people - Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to civil society organisations to hold government to account for limiting negative impacts of oil and gas developmentsWe will advocate for policy makers to put in place policies, laws and regulations. We will hold authorities accountable for enforcing regulations and implementing environmental monitoring. We will empower affected communities to hold governments to account by giving them facts and access to local government, as well as train media and society organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
